# ---- 只跟踪本项目：默认忽略一切，再白名单放行 ----
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/README.en.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!/.github/
!/tg-hotlist/
!/exdesktop/

# 通用
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store

# tg-hotlist 运行产物 / 敏感文件（登录会话、你的配置、日志、导出）
tg-hotlist/.venv/
tg-hotlist/__pycache__/
tg-hotlist/output/
tg-hotlist/session_backup_ayu/
tg-hotlist/wheels/
tg-hotlist/*.session
tg-hotlist/tdata_import.json
tg-hotlist/config.json
tg-hotlist/backend.log
tg-hotlist/qr_login.svg

# exdesktop：客户端本体（260MB+）与运行数据不入库
exdesktop/app/
exdesktop/backup_before_update/
exdesktop/__pycache__/
exdesktop/.edge-panel/
